      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BELL MAC MAGIC (6) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (23.05) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 400m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. One of the leading chances. ROSACKY RAYO (2) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from four tries. Missed the frame latest (18.62) when fourth over 318m at this track in a NG. Makes strong appeal on best. DEL MAR JESSIE (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (23.64) last time in a Free For All at this track. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. MICK'S OVER (4) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a one length third (18.71) in a NG at this track.",
